slerp-sketchup reads SketchUp files by the layouts that the OpenSKP project
found by reverse engineering (https://github.com/iamahsanmehmood/openskp).
Its readers for the 2021 and later container (`src/vff.rs`) and for the
classic MFC container (`src/legacy.rs`), the texture-coordinate recipe and
the face colours of styles are ports of OpenSKP's Python edition (version
1.3.0, commit 359d1836c9665484c193635796a54aef004babac), used under its
licence:

